node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored here -- internal/http/handlers/nock_page.go's own go:embed
# bakes this directory straight into the IDUNA binary, so the built output has to be a real,
# committed file, not a build artifact recreated by a Go-only `go build`/CI pipeline that never
# runs npm. Re-run `npm run build` and commit the result after any frontend source change (see
# that file's own doc comment for the real, honest limitation this implies).

